        "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6600K / AMD FX8350 or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 980 / AMD Radeon R9 290X equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Video Output: Compatible HDMI 1.3 video output, USB Ports: 1x USB 3.0 port, plus 2x USB 2.0 ports</li></ul>"
